<title>NETHERLANDS: IHC CALAND 1996 NET PROFIT NLG 93.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>IHC CALAND 1996 NET PROFIT NLG 93.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>SCHIEDAM, Netherlands 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Dec 31.</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net per shr (guilders)	     3.66 vs   3.17</p>
<p>    Net profit			    93.2  vs  75.3</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  1.80 vs   1.60</p>
<p>    Turnover (billions)		  1.52 vs   0.93</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    93.1  vs  74.5</p>
<p>    Tax				     15.4  vs  17.5</p>
<p>    Order book at yr end (billion)   3.04 vs   2.94</p>
<p>NOTE - Shipbuilding and engineering group IHC Caland said in</p>
<p>January it expected a 1996 net of about 93 million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
